# Project-owned terminfo for the sequences implemented by Terminal.
#
# This entry intentionally does not inherit xterm-256color: inherited entries
# advertise output, queries, OSC features and private extensions that have not
# been audited here. Keep TERM=xterm-256color until this entry is available on
# remote hosts as well as in the app bundle.
#
# Source terminology: ncurses terminfo(5), xterm ctlseqs. Representative output
# capabilities below are exercised by `dev terminfo-smoke` (tools/Dev/TerminfoSmoke.swift).
